<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Saiman Silwal - Personal Page</title>
<style>
:root{
--primary:#0f766e;
--accent:#14b8a6;
--bg:#f0fdfa;
--card:#ffffff;
--text:#134e4a;
--nav:#1e293b;
--radius:12px;
--space:20px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:var(--bg);
color:var(--text);
}
nav{
position:fixed;
top:0;
left:0;
width:100%;
height:60px;
background:var(--nav);
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:space-between;
padding:0 30px;
z-index:1000;
}
.logo{color:white;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;}
.links{display:flex;gap:25px;}
.links a{color:white;text-decoration:none;}
.links a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
.hero{
min-height:500px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
padding:80px var(--space) 40px;
animation:fadeIn 1.5s ease;
}
.hero h1{font-size:48px;margin:10px;}
.hero p{font-size:20px;}
.button{
background:var(--primary);
color:white;
padding:12px 24px;
border-radius:var(--radius);
text-decoration:none;
transition:background .3s ease;
}
.button:hover{background:var(--accent);}
.sticky-title{
position:sticky;
top:60px;
background:var(--bg);
padding:15px 0;
z-index:10;
}
.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr;
gap:var(--space);
padding-bottom:500px;
}
.card{
position:relative;
background:var(--card);
border:2px solid var(--primary);
border-radius:var(--radius);
padding:45px var(--space) var(--space);
transition:transform .3s ease,box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.card::before{
content:"✨";
position:absolute;
top:15px;
left:20px;
font-size:24px;
}
.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
box-shadow:0 12px 25px rgba(20,184,166,.35);
}
@keyframes fadeIn{
from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
@media (min-width:640px){
.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
:root{
--primary:#5eead4;
--accent:#2dd4bf;
--bg:#0f2927;
--card:#163b38;
--text:#ccfbf1;
--nav:#020617;
}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
<div class="logo">SAIMAN</div>
<div class="links">
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#skills">Skills</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
</div>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
<h1>Hello, I'm Saiman Silwal</h1>
<p>Computer Engineering Student at Gachon University</p>
<a class="button" href="#skills">View My Skills</a>
</section>

<section id="skills">
<h2 class="sticky-title">My Skills</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>💻 Programming</h3>
<p>Basic knowledge of C, C++, Java and Python.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🌐 Web Development</h3>
<p>Creating websites using HTML and CSS.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🤖 Machine Learning</h3>
<p>Learning the basics of machine learning and data processing.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="about" style="padding:20px;">
<h2>About Me</h2>
<p>I am Saiman Silwal, a Computer Engineering student who enjoys technology, gaming, anime and learning new skills.</p>
</section>
</body>
</html>
